Third-party code inside JUCE
============================

JUCE carries these libraries in its modules (its JUCE.spdx.json lists them
with their exact sources). The ones below are compiled into the Zederia
plug-in, the Standalone and the command-line tool, because the JUCE modules
Zederia uses contain them:

  zlib 1.3.2 (data compression)                      zlib License
  HarfBuzz 15.0.0 (text shaping)                     MIT License (old variant)
  SheenBidi 2.9.0 (bidirectional text)               Apache License 2.0
  LunaSVG 3.5.0 and PlutoVG 1.3.2 (SVG drawing)      MIT License
  libpng 1.6.58 (PNG images)                         libpng License 2.0
  libjpeg 10.0, Independent JPEG Group (JPEG images) IJG License
  libwebp 1.6.0 (WebP images)                        BSD 3-Clause License
  FLAC 1.5.0 (audio file decoding)                   BSD 3-Clause License
  libogg 1.3.6 and libvorbis 1.3.7 (audio files)     BSD 3-Clause License
  Opus 1.6.1, opusfile 0.12 and libopusenc 0.3       BSD 3-Clause License
  LV2 1.18.0, lilv 0.24.12, serd 0.30.10,
  sord 0.16.9 and sratom 0.6.8 (plug-in hosting)     ISC License

